OL,4,CHotels need 'minimum standards' to     
OL,5,Ckeep women safe                        
OL,6,GHotels should face national minimum    
OL,7,Gstandards to protect female guests,    
OL,8,Gwitnesses have told a parliamentary    
OL,9,Gcommittee examining safety in the      
OL,10,Gindustry.                              
OL,12,FThe hearing followed an independent    
OL,13,Freview into security failings at       
OL,14,FTravelodge after a woman was sexually  
OL,15,Fassaulted at one of its hotels in      
OL,16,FMaidenhead, Berkshire.                 
